OL,3,GNEWSAHelicopters to be put on standby
OL,4,Awhen wildfire risk is high
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,F(SFRS) will be able to put helicopters
OL,8,Fon standby when there is a heightened
OL,9,Frisk of wildfires, the justice
OL,10,Fsecretary has said.
OL,12,FNeil Gray said aerial water bombing was
OL,13,Fa key part of the effort to deal with a
OL,14,Fmajor blaze in the Cairngorms this
OL,15,Fsummer, but helicopters were not
OL,16,Favailable until about 36 hours after
OL,17,Fthe fire broke out.
OL,19,FHe said SFRS would be able to use a
OL,20,Fcurrent contractual framework to
OL,21,Fprepare commercial helicopters to be
OL,22,Fmobilised when they might be needed.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
