OL,3,GNEWSAHelicopters to be put on standby
OL,4,Awhen wildfire risk is high
OL,5,
OL,6,FGray also called for England, Wales and
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland to work with Scotland
OL,8,Fto deal with an "increased risk" of
OL,9,Fwildfires caused by climate change.
